  <page_number>9</page_number>
  <running_head>De Duellis.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>nem.</catchword>
    <signature>A 5.</signature>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">Bassæus, quo cum etiam con-</l>
    <l n="2">sentit Bonacina, cui duellum</l>
    <l n="3">est: <i>pugna singularis deliberata ab</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">
      <i>utraque parte, sponte &amp; ex condicto</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5">
      <i>suscepta, cum periculo occisionis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>vel mutilationis, aut vulneris.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7" para="true">Verùm, ut quod res est di-</l>
    <l n="8">cam, &amp; isthoc modo duelli vo-</l>
    <l n="9">cabulum nimium coarctatur</l>
    <l n="10">eò quòd omnia duella ludicra,</l>
    <l n="11">qualia sunt hastiludia, ensilu-</l>
    <l n="12">dia, torneamenta, aliaque plu-</l>
    <l n="13">ra, quæ excludantur. Etiam il-</l>
    <l n="14">la, judicis auctoritate, &amp; qui-</l>
    <l n="15">dem partibus invitis, saltem</l>
    <l n="16">non petentibus, imponuntur.</l>
    <l n="17">Quæ omnia tamen duellorum</l>
    <l n="18">venire appellatione, adeo cer-</l>
    <l n="19">tum est, quàm quod certissi-</l>
    <l n="20">mum. Finis equidem eorum</l>
    <l n="21">est veritatis indagatio, ac du-</l>
    <l n="22">bii litis eventus decifio. Ut in-</l>
    <l n="23">super hoc adjiciam, nec loci</l>
    <l n="24">assignationem, nec temporis</l>
    <l n="25">indictionem, quicquam ad es-</l>
    <l n="26">sentiam, aut formalem ratio-</l>
  </main_text>
  <marginalia>
    <note side="right" at="Bassæus, quo cum" line_from="1" line_to="1">Bonacina Tom. 1. fol.597. num.2.&amp; seq.</note>
  </marginalia>
